WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.468 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome back!
-Thank you. It's been a while.

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:03.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it has been a while.
And I really appreciate this.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
You took a red-eye today, yes?
Or, last night.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-But for a good reason.

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.910 line:92%
You're in L.A. to give an award.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.645 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-To give a tribute --

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.180 line:92%
a tribute because George Clooney

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.017 align:start size:94% position:6%
got the A.F.I.
Lifetime Achievement award.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Which is a fantastic award.
-Yeah.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
-Yeah.

00:00:21.755 --> 00:00:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would imagine...
-It was pretty great.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:27.494
-...versus most award shows,
that night is so much better.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's so much better.
-Yeah.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:30.964
-First of all, everyone's there
'cause they want to be.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And everyone speak --

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:37.404
Everyone's chosen to give him
a tribute because they love him.

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:41.775
-And so their words are for real
rather than some fake bull.

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:42.208 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know,
and everyone's nodding.

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
It truly was
very emotional and beautiful.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
And his dad spoke,
and Amal spoke.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I got a little teary
because, you know,

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
honestly, I owe my career
to George Clooney.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:54.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I do.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:57.624
-I mean, he -- but, wouldn't you
say that he owes as much to you?

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, you guys --
-No, no, no, let me explain.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.129 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I seriously owe my career
to George Clooney.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:03.696 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, gotcha.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:07.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because my character died
in the pilot of "ER."

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:07.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, wow.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.504
-And I was about to sign on
to a not-very-good sitcom,

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:15.308
'cause I came back to New York,
I needed a job.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he called me
out of the blue,

00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:18.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
kind of put his neck out
on the line for me and said,

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:24.084
"I overheard that your character
tested well, and if I were you,

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:26.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wouldn't take another job,
because I think

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
they're gonna
bring you back to life."

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:28.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's amazing.
-Yeah.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:31.891
-So, really, in the end,
that was the greatest save

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.893
he ever did in the E.R.
is he brought you back to life.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:36.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He brought me back to life.
-Yeah. I mean, that is --

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:38.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, for all of them...
-He did.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:39.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I always remember,
it was --

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.134
You know, for me, I always
thought it was really touching,

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
your last episode,
that George came back

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.238 line:92%
and did that great cameo.

00:01:45.238 --> 00:01:47.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I thought, like,
"Oh, these are two people

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.109 size:78% position:39%
who obviously really
care about each other

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
for something
like that to happen."

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:54.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was --
We did all of that in secret.

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:56.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I remember being
blown away that he would --

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:57.984 line:92%
I mean, it was a great reveal.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:00.386
-No, I mean,
not even the cast and crew knew.

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:01.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-And, when I heard --

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.289
-Did you just bring in the tape,
and you're like,

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Put this in the episode,
you guys"?

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I shot something on it
with a side crew."

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.130 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They actually --
They flew us to Seattle.

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.066
But they flew George
on the Warner Bros. private jet.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
I took commercial.
-Right.

